dsh-node-mindmap
================

Third-party components bundled into lib/client.js:

- mind-elixir 5.15.1
  Copyright (c) 2019 DjZhou
  License: MIT (full text in vendor/LICENSE)
  Source: https://github.com/ssshooter/mind-elixir-core
  Bundled as the IIFE build (vendor/MindElixir.iife.js) plus its stylesheet
  (vendor/MindElixir.css).

The Markdown tree parser in src/core.js is an original implementation for this
plugin; it borrows the problem framing (headings/lists -> tree) from
tuogusa/dsh-mindmap but not its source.
